{
  "d42": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\n<title>Hand Post Sender</title>\n<style>\n/* Tokens: shared/tokens.json (design-parchment-ledger). The native app is held to light, so this page has one theme. */\n:root {\n  --paper:#F2E9DA; --card:#FCF6EA; --ink:#332E3F; --inkSoft:#6E6379; --line:#DCCDB6; --accent:#6F5CA6;\n  --green:#2E7A5E; --greenSoft:#E6E7D7; --red:#A8443C; --manila:#EADBBA; --manilaInk:#695832; --gold:#C9A961;\n  --cochin: Cochin, \"Cochin\", Georgia, serif;\n  --mono: Menlo, ui-monospace, monospace;\n  /* Status bar foot: unmeasured on the Duo inner screen. Drawn at the UI test's 20 pt floor (DuoHandUITests.statusBarFloor). */\n  --sat: max(env(safe-area-inset-top), 20px);\n  --keys-top: 405px;  /* the keyboard panel draws from about y 405 pt (debt duo-keyboard-gap-unmeasured); its frame starts at 449 */\n  --new:#2E7A5E; --today:#A8443C;\n}\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody { margin:0; background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink); font-family:-apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:15px; line-height:1.4; }\nmain { max-width:1040px; margin:0 auto; padding:16px; }\n.banner { background:var(--manila); color:var(--manilaInk); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:8px; padding:8px 12px; font-weight:600; }\nh1 { font-family:var(--cochin); font-size:24px; margin:16px 0 4px; }\n.sub { color:var(--inkSoft); margin:0 0 12px; }\nnav { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; margin:12px 0; }\nnav a, nav button { font:inherit; font-size:14px; min-height:44px; padding:0 12px; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; border:1px solid var(--line);\n  border-radius:8px; background:var(--card); color:var(--ink); text-decoration:none; cursor:pointer; }\nnav a[aria-current=\"true\"] { border-color:var(--accent); color:var(--accent); font-weight:600; }\nfigure { margin:24px 0; }\nfigure[hidden] { display:none; }\nfigcaption { margin-top:8px; }\nfigcaption b { font-family:var(--cochin); font-size:18px; }\n.fit { width:100%; overflow:hidden; }\nul.tags { margin:8px 0 0; padding-left:20px; color:var(--inkSoft); font-size:14px; }\n\n/* ---- device: iPhone Duo inner screen, open, 951 x 669 pt, 1 CSS px = 1 pt ---- */\n.duo { position:relative; width:951px; height:669px; background:var(--paper); border:1px solid var(--ink); border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden;\n  font-family:-apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; }\n.status { position:absolute; left:0; right:0; top:0; height:var(--sat); display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;\n  padding:0 16px; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; z-index:5; }\n.page { position:absolute; top:0; bottom:0; width:455.5px; overflow:hidden; }\n.page.l { left:0; } .page.r { left:495.5px; }\n.fold { position:absolute; top:0; bottom:0; left:455.5px; width:40px; background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--line) 45%, transparent); }\n.fold span { position:absolute; top:200px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%) rotate(-90deg); font:10.5px var(--mono); color:var(--inkSoft); letter-spacing:1.2px; }\n/* The system keyboard: iOS chrome, not an app colour, so these three greys sit outside the tokens. */\n.keys { position:absolute; left:0; right:0; top:var(--keys-top); bottom:0; background:#D2D0D6; z-index:6; padding:8px 6px; }\n.keys .row { display:flex; gap:6px; margin-bottom:8px; justify-content:center; }\n.keys .k { height:42px; flex:0 0 42px; background:#FFFFFF; border-radius:6px; display:grid; place-items:center; font-size:18px; color:#111; }\n.keys .k.w { flex-basis:300px; font-size:14px; }\n.keys .note { position:absolute; left:12px; top:-1px; transform:translateY(-100%); font:10.5px var(--mono); color:var(--inkSoft); background:var(--paper); padding:2px 4px; }\n.guide { position:absolute; left:0; right:0; height:0; border-top:1px dashed var(--accent); z-index:7; }\n.guide span { position:absolute; left:120px; top:-14px; font:10.5px var(--mono); color:var(--accent); background:var(--paper); padding:0 2px; }\n\n/* ---- app content: Cochin sets words, Menlo sets numbers (typography-cochin-and-mono) ---- */\n.content { position:absolute; left:16px; right:16px; top:calc(var(--sat) + 16px); display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px; font-family:var(--cochin); }\n.r .content { gap:8px; }\n.micro { font:10.5px/13px var(--mono); letter-spacing:1.2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--inkSoft); height:13px; }\n.who { font-size:22px; line-height:27px; font-weight:700; height:27px; }\n.meta { font:11px/14px var(--mono); color:var(--inkSoft); height:14px; }\n.pill { font:12px var(--mono); border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--card); border-radius:8px; padding:6px 10px; color:var(--ink); white-space:nowrap; }\n.hit { min-height:44px; min-width:44px; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }\n.lines { background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden; }\n.line { display:flex; gap:8px; height:64px; padding-left:4px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--card); }\n.line:first-child { border-top:0; }\n.line .box { flex:0 0 45px; height:45px; display:grid; place-items:center; }\n.line .box i { width:30px; height:30px; border:1.5px solid var(--inkSoft); border-radius:6px; display:block; }\n.line .t { flex:1; padding:12px 12px 12px 0; }\n.line .t b { font-size:14px; font-weight:600; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:8px; }\n.line .t b span { font:12px var(--mono); color:var(--inkSoft); font-weight:400; }\n.line .t small { font-size:11.5px; color:var(--inkSoft); display:block; margin-top:4px; }\n.line.done { background:var(--greenSoft); }\n.line.done .box i { background:var(--green); border-color:var(--green); position:relative; }\n.line.done .box i::after { content:\"\"; position:absolute; left:9px; top:4px; width:8px; height:14px; border:solid var(--card); border-width:0 3px 3px 0; transform:rotate(45deg); }\n.offer { height:110px; background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--manila) 50%, transparent); border-radius:8px; padding:12px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; }\n.offer p { margin:0; font-size:13px; line-height:17px; height:34px; }\n.offer .post { font:700 12px var(--mono); background:var(--accent); border-color:var(--accent); color:var(--card); }\n.offer .receipt { height:44px; display:flex; align-items:center; font:12px var(--mono); color:var(--green); }\n.notice { background:var(--manila); color:var(--manilaInk); border-radius:8px; padding:12px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:2px; }\n.notice .micro { color:var(--manilaInk); }\n.notice b { font-size:15px; } .notice small { font-size:12.5px; }\n.field { height:48px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--card); border-radius:8px; padding:0 12px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-size:16px; }\n.field::after { content:\"\"; width:2px; height:20px; background:var(--accent); margin-left:1px; }\n.rowx { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:8px; }\n.rowx .soft { color:var(--inkSoft); font-size:14px; }\n.match { min-height:44px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-size:14px; }\n.count { font:12px var(--mono); color:var(--inkSoft); }\n\n/* option B: the sender head is pinned above the scroll view; the offer is pinned above the keys */\n.head { position:absolute; left:0; right:0; top:var(--sat); padding:16px 16px 8px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; font-family:var(--cochin);\n  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--paper); z-index:2; }\n.mid { position:absolute; left:16px; right:16px; top:calc(var(--sat) + 94px); bottom:calc(669px - var(--keys-top) + 126px); overflow:hidden; padding-top:8px; font-family:var(--cochin); }\n.foot { position:absolute; left:16px; right:16px; bottom:calc(669px - var(--keys-top)); padding:8px 0; font-family:var(--cochin); }\n\n/* tags: dashed outline on what exists today, and on what an option adds */\n[data-tag] { position:relative; }\n[data-tag]::before { content:attr(data-tag); position:absolute; right:4px; top:-9px; font:600 10.5px/14px -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; padding:0 4px;\n  background:var(--paper); z-index:4; white-space:nowrap; }\n.head[data-tag]::before { top:auto; bottom:-8px; }\n.tag-new { outline:2px dashed var(--new); outline-offset:2px; } .tag-new::before { color:var(--new); }\n.tag-today { outline:2px dashed var(--today); outline-offset:2px; } .tag-today::before { color:var(--today); }\n\n/* folded frame: the outer screen, 382 x 644 pt of safe content (duo-fold-and-keyboard), drawn at half size */\n.folded { position:relative; width:191px; height:322px; border:1px solid var(--ink); border-radius:12px; background:var(--paper);\n  padding:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top) + 12px) 12px calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom) + 12px); font-size:12px; color:var(--inkSoft); }\n.folded b { font-family:var(--cochin); color:var(--ink); font-size:14px; display:block; margin-bottom:4px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<div class=\"banner\">Sample. No figure, seller, card or count on this page is real. Row heights are estimates from the code, not measurements.</div>\n<h1>Card in Hand: the Post offer keeps the sender</h1>\n<p class=\"sub\">iPhone Duo, open pose, 951 x 669 pt, fold 40 pt at 455.5 pt. Keys up; the panel draws from y 405 pt. Status bar foot drawn at 20 pt (unmeasured). Light theme only: the native app is held to light. Debt <code>hand-post-scroll-hides-sender</code>.</p>\n\n<nav aria-label=\"States\">\n  <a href=\"#s=today\">Today</a>\n  <a href=\"#s=a\">A: offer under the sender (pick)</a>\n  <a href=\"#s=a-posted\">A after Post</a>\n  <a href=\"#s=b\">B: pinned head and foot</a>\n  <a href=\"#s=folded\">Folded</a>\n  <a href=\"#\">All</a>\n  <button type=\"button\" data-hide=\"a\">Hide option A</button>\n  <button type=\"button\" data-hide=\"b\">Hide option B</button>\n</nav>\n\n<!-- Folded first (ios-apps, Mockups). Card in Hand does not open folded. -->\n<figure id=\"s-folded\" data-state=\"folded\">\n  <div class=\"folded\" data-device=\"iphone-duo-folded\">\n    <b>Folded: unchanged</b>\n    Card in Hand opens only on two pages side by side (<code>PackagesTab.twoPages</code>). The folded screen keeps today's one-page Packages. Nothing to draw.\n  </div>\n  <figcaption><b>Folded.</b> No change in this lane.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n<template id=\"left-held\">\n  <div class=\"page l\"><div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"rowx\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:17px\">Mail day</span><span class=\"count\">41 in \u00b7 23 out</span><span class=\"hit\"><span class=\"pill\">Close</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"field\">Path to Exile</div>\n    <div class=\"notice\"><span class=\"micro\">Suspense</span><b>Lightning Bolt</b><small>Not checked in.</small></div>\n    <div class=\"rowx\"><span class=\"soft\">This envelope</span><span class=\"hit\"><span class=\"pill\">New envelope</span></span></div>\n    <span class=\"micro\">Matches</span>\n    <div class=\"match\">Path to Exile</div>\n  </div></div>\n</template>\n<template id=\"left-posted\">\n  <div class=\"page l\"><div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"rowx\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:17px\">Mail day</span><span class=\"count\">43 in \u00b7 21 out</span><span class=\"hit\"><span class=\"pill\">Close</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"field\">Path to Exile</div>\n    <div class=\"rowx\"><span class=\"soft\">This envelope</span><span class=\"hit\"><span class=\"pill\">New envelope</span></span></div>\n  </div></div>\n</template>\n<template id=\"lines-open\">\n  <div class=\"lines\">\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"box\"><i></i></span><span class=\"t\"><b>Lightning Bolt<span>$0.42</span></b><small>Sample Set \u00b7 NM</small></span></div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"box\"><i></i></span><span class=\"t\"><b>Path to Exile<span>$0.31</span></b><small>Sample Set \u00b7 NM</small></span></div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"box\"><i></i></span><span class=\"t\"><b>Swords to Plowshares<span>$0.55</span></b><small>Sample Set \u00b7 LP</small></span></div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"box\"><i></i></span><span class=\"t\"><b>Ponder<span>$0.18</span></b><small>Sample Set \u00b7 NM</small></span></div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"box\"><i></i></span><span class=\"t\"><b>Preordain<span>$0.20</span></b><small>Sample Set \u00b7 NM</small></span></div>\n  </div>\n</template>\n<template id=\"lines-posted\">\n  <div class=\"lines\">\n    <div class=\"line done\"><span class=\"box\"><i></i></span><span class=\"t\"><b>Lightning Bolt<span>$0.42</span></b><small>Sample Set \u00b7 NM</small></span></div>\n    <div class=\"line done\"><span class=\"box\"><i></i></span><span class=\"t\"><b>Path to Exile<span>$0.31</span></b><small>Sample Set \u00b7 NM</small></span></div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"box\"><i></i></span><span class=\"t\"><b>Swords to Plowshares<span>$0.55</span></b><small>Sample Set \u00b7 LP</small></span></div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"box\"><i></i></span><span class=\"t\"><b>Ponder<span>$0.18</span></b><small>Sample Set \u00b7 NM</small></span></div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"box\"><i></i></span><span class=\"t\"><b>Preordain<span>$0.20</span></b><small>Sample Set \u00b7 NM</small></span></div>\n  </div>\n</template>\n<template id=\"chrome\">\n  <div class=\"fold\"><span>FOLD</span></div>\n  <div class=\"status\"><span>9:41</span><span>\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf 100%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"guide\" style=\"top:var(--sat)\"><span>y 20 \u00b7 status bar foot (unmeasured)</span></div>\n  <div class=\"keys\">\n    <span class=\"note\">keys panel from y 405 \u00b7 frame from y 449</span>\n    <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"k\">q</span><span class=\"k\">w</span><span class=\"k\">e</span><span class=\"k\">r</span><span class=\"k\">t</span><span class=\"k\">y</span><span class=\"k\">u</span><span class=\"k\">i</span><span class=\"k\">o</span><span class=\"k\">p</span></div>\n    <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"k\">a</span><span class=\"k\">s</span><span class=\"k\">d</span><span class=\"k\">f</span><span class=\"k\">g</span><span class=\"k\">h</span><span class=\"k\">j</span><span class=\"k\">k</span><span class=\"k\">l</span></div>\n    <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"k\">z</span><span class=\"k\">x</span><span class=\"k\">c</span><span class=\"k\">v</span><span class=\"k\">b</span><span class=\"k\">n</span><span class=\"k\">m</span></div>\n    <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"k w\">space</span><span class=\"k\" style=\"flex-basis:90px;font-size:14px\">done</span></div>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<!-- Today: measured on the simulator, \"It came from\" at y -152 and the seller at y -131. -->\n<figure id=\"s-today\" data-state=\"today\">\n  <div class=\"fit\"><div class=\"duo\" data-device=\"iphone-duo-unfolded\" data-fill=\"left-held chrome\">\n    <div class=\"page r\">\n      <div class=\"content\" style=\"transform:translateY(-188px)\">\n        <span class=\"micro tag-today\" data-tag=\"Today: y -152, off the page\">It came from</span>\n        <span class=\"who\">Gamma Cards</span>\n        <span class=\"meta\">ordered 2026-07-01</span>\n        <div data-fill=\"lines-open\"></div>\n        <div class=\"offer tag-today\" data-tag=\"Today: scrolled to the keys frame\">\n          <p>Your held card came with this envelope. Nothing is checked in until you post.</p>\n          <span class=\"hit\" style=\"align-self:flex-start\"><span class=\"pill post\">Post 2 cards here, 1 held</span></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></div>\n  <figcaption><b>Today.</b> <code>revealOffer</code> scrolls the offer to the foot of the space above the keys. The sender leaves the top; rows run under the clock. \"Post \u2026 here\" names no envelope.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n<!-- Option A (pick): the offer sits under the sender, above the lines. Nothing needs the keyboard figure. -->\n<figure id=\"s-a\" data-state=\"a\" data-opt=\"a\">\n  <div class=\"fit\"><div class=\"duo\" data-device=\"iphone-duo-unfolded\" data-fill=\"left-held chrome\">\n    <div class=\"page r\">\n      <div class=\"content\">\n        <span class=\"micro tag-today\" data-tag=\"Today: It came from\">It came from</span>\n        <span class=\"who\" id=\"a-who\">Gamma Cards</span>\n        <span class=\"meta\">ordered 2026-07-01</span>\n        <div class=\"offer tag-new\" id=\"focus-a\" data-tag=\"New: offer under the sender, y 114 to 224\">\n          <p>Your held card came with this envelope. Nothing is checked in until you post.</p>\n          <span class=\"hit\" style=\"align-self:flex-start\"><span class=\"pill post\">Post 2 cards here, 1 held</span></span>\n        </div>\n        <div data-fill=\"lines-open\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></div>\n  <figcaption><b>Option A, the pick: offer under the sender.</b> Sender at y 36 to 106, Post hit frame at y 168 to 212, all far above the keys at 405. Below the offer: 2 whole lines, and the third shows its top 44 pt before the keys. 0 lines above the offer. The page sits at its top, so nothing is under the status bar.</figcaption>\n  <ul class=\"tags\"><li>Lines scroll as today. The offer is in the scroll content, not pinned.</li><li>Fits with no keyboard figure: the Post button clears the keys by 193 pt.</li></ul>\n</figure>\n\n<figure id=\"s-a-posted\" data-state=\"a-posted\" data-opt=\"a\">\n  <div class=\"fit\"><div class=\"duo\" data-device=\"iphone-duo-unfolded\" data-fill=\"left-posted chrome\">\n    <div class=\"page r\">\n      <div class=\"content\">\n        <span class=\"micro\">It came from</span>\n        <span class=\"who\">Gamma Cards</span>\n        <span class=\"meta\">ordered 2026-07-01</span>\n        <div class=\"offer tag-new\" id=\"focus-a-posted\" data-tag=\"New: receipt holds the slot\">\n          <p>Posted with this envelope. The next card you type clears this line.</p>\n          <span class=\"receipt\">2 cards checked in \u00b7 1 was held</span>\n        </div>\n        <div data-fill=\"lines-posted\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></div>\n  <figcaption><b>Option A after Post.</b> A same-height receipt takes the offer's slot, so the lines stay put and no line slides under the finger that pressed Post. A refused Post (the ledger changed since the offer) holds the slot too, with the refusal line. It goes when the next card is typed or New envelope ends the envelope.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n<!-- Option B: sender pinned above the scroll view, offer pinned above the keys. Rests on the unmeasured 44 pt figure. -->\n<figure id=\"s-b\" data-state=\"b\" data-opt=\"b\">\n  <div class=\"fit\"><div class=\"duo\" data-device=\"iphone-duo-unfolded\" data-fill=\"left-held chrome\">\n    <div class=\"page r\">\n      <div class=\"head tag-new\" data-tag=\"New: pinned sender head\">\n        <span class=\"micro\">It came from</span>\n        <span class=\"who\">Gamma Cards</span>\n        <span class=\"meta\">ordered 2026-07-01</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mid\"><div data-fill=\"lines-open\"></div></div>\n      <div class=\"foot\">\n        <div class=\"offer tag-new\" id=\"focus-b\" data-tag=\"New: offer pinned above the keys\">\n          <p>Your held card came with this envelope. Nothing is checked in until you post.</p>\n          <span class=\"hit\" style=\"align-self:flex-start\"><span class=\"pill post\">Post 2 cards here, 1 held</span></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></div>\n  <figcaption><b>Option B: pinned head and foot.</b> Sender head y 20 to 114, lines scroll in y 114 to 279, offer y 287 to 397. 2 whole lines above the offer, and the top 28 pt of a third. Keeps today's order (offer under the lines).</figcaption>\n  <ul class=\"tags\"><li>SwiftUI's keyboard inset ends at the keys frame, y 449. The foot clears the drawn panel at 405 only with a 44 pt pad, an unmeasured figure. If the panel draws higher, Post sits under the keys and cannot be scrolled to.</li><li>After Post it needs the same receipt as A, or the lines grow into the slot under the finger.</li></ul>\n</figure>\n</main>\n\n<script>\n// Fill each frame from its templates, so the shared parts are drawn once.\ndocument.querySelectorAll('[data-fill]').forEach(el => {\n  el.getAttribute('data-fill').split(' ').forEach(id => el.append(document.getElementById(id).content.cloneNode(true)));\n});\n// Scale each 951 pt frame to the page width; the page never scrolls sideways.\nfunction fit() {\n  document.querySelectorAll('.fit').forEach(w => { const d = w.firstElementChild; const s = Math.min(1, w.clientWidth / 951);\n    d.style.zoom = s; });\n}\n// Deep link: #s=<state> shows one state; no hash shows all. A hide button removes one option.\nconst hidden = new Set();\nfunction route() {\n  const m = location.hash.match(/s=([\\w-]+)/), s = m && m[1];\n  document.querySelectorAll('figure').forEach(f => {\n    f.hidden = (s && f.dataset.state !== s) || hidden.has(f.dataset.opt);\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('nav a').forEach(a => a.setAttribute('aria-current', String(a.getAttribute('href') === (location.hash || '#'))));\n  fit();\n}\ndocument.querySelectorAll('[data-hide]').forEach(b => b.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  const o = b.dataset.hide; hidden.has(o) ? hidden.delete(o) : hidden.add(o);\n  b.textContent = (hidden.has(o) ? 'Show option ' : 'Hide option ') + o.toUpperCase(); route();\n}));\naddEventListener('hashchange', route); addEventListener('resize', fit); route();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
}
